//   - *CoreSubscriptionRequiredError (402 core.subscription-required): The organization has no active paid
//     subscription: it is read-only, it can read and export but not write.
//   - *AuthRightMissingError (403 auth.right.missing): The caller lacks the right this operation requires in this
//     organization.
