// POST /organizations/{id}/invoices/{invoiceId}/debit · requires STRIPE_PAYMENTS_COLLECT.
//
// Safe to retry: an Idempotency-Key is generated for the call and reused by its retries (give your own with
// myle.IdempotencyKey).
//
// It answers the invoice's payment status, the debit started.
//
// Errors worth handling (errors.As):
//
//   - *CoreModuleRequiredError (402 core.module-required): The organization's plan or settings lack the module this
//     operation belongs to.
//   - *CoreSubscriptionRequiredError (402 core.subscription-required): The organization has no active paid
//     subscription: it is read-only, it can read and export but not write.
//   - *PaymentPlanCollectionRequiredError (402 payments.plan.collection-required): The organization's plan does not
//     carry Stripe collection (SEPA debits, mandates, auto-debit, online payment of invoices); the trial does not
//     either. It comes with a paid plan.
//   - *AuthRightMissingError (403 auth.right.missing): The caller lacks the right this operation requires in this
//     organization.
//   - *AuthStepUpRequiredError (403 auth.step-up.required): This operation needs a fresh passkey proof (a WebAuthn
//     step-up) for this action.
//   - *CoreNotFoundError (404 core.not-found): What the path names does not exist, or the caller cannot see it (the
//     same answer for both).
//   - *BillingInvoiceStripeImportedError (409 billing.invoice.stripe-imported): The invoice was imported from
//     Stripe (Myle's own subscriptions): it is managed in Stripe, never written in Myle.
//   - *PaymentAccountDemoError (409 payments.account.demo): A demo organization never reaches Stripe: nothing was
//     done.
//   - *PaymentCollectionDisabledError (409 payments.collection.disabled): The organization turned its Stripe
//     collection off (in its payment settings): nothing is debited, no mandate is offered, no auto-debit is turned
//     on until it turns it back on.
//   - *PaymentCollectionPausedError (409 payments.collection.paused): The organization's Stripe collection is
//     paused because it no longer pays for Myle: it resumes with its subscription.
